targeting to the endoplasmic reticulum</article-title><source>Embo J</source><year>1992</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>4197</fpage><lpage>4203</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1396600</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schillberg</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Zimmermann</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Findlay</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Fischer</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Plasma membrane display of anti-viral single chain Fv fragments confers resistance to tobacco mosaic virus</article-title><source>Molecular Breeding</source><year>2000</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>317</fpage><lpage>326</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1023/A:1009697604758</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zhao</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Onduka</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kinoshita</surname><given-names>JY</given-names></name><name><surname>Honsho</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kinoshita</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Shimazaki</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Ito</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Dual subcellular distribution of cytochrome b5 in plant, cauliflower, cells</article-title><source>J Biochem (Tokyo)</source><year>2003</year><volume>133</volume><fpage>115</fpage><lpage>121</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12761206</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schouten</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Roosien</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>van Engel